---

---

<section class="why-clinic">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="why-content">
      <h2 class="why-title">
        なぜ<span>内科</span>でAGA治療？
      </h2>
      <div class="why-cards">
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>入りやすい</h3>
          <p>普通の内科クリニックなので、<br />周りの目が気になりません</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>話しやすい</h3>
          <p>内科医が対応するので、<br />健康面も含めて相談できます</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.59 13.41l-7.17 7.17a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82z"/><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="7.01" y2="7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>シンプルな料金</h3>
          <p>お薬代のみ。<br />不要なオプションの勧誘なし</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>仙台市中心部</h3>
          <p>勾当台公園駅 徒歩2分。<br />アクセス抜群の立地</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>夜21時まで</h3>
          <p>お仕事帰りにサッと<br />受け取れます</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>土日も対応</h3>
          <p>平日忙しい方も<br />週末に通院できます</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="why-note">
        「AGAクリニック」の看板が目立つところは避けたい。<br class="pc-only" />
        そんな方のために、普通の内科でAGA治療薬を処方しています。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why-clinic {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .why-content {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .why-title {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .why-title span {
    color: var(--color-highlight);
  }

  .why-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .why-card {
    padding: 32px 24px;
    background: var(--color-bg-section);
    border-radius: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .why-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .card-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .card-icon svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }

  .why-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .why-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .why-note {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.8;
    padding: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.05) 0%, rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.05) 100%);
    border-radius: 12px;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pc-only {
    display: inline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .why-cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .why-clinic {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .why-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .why-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .why-card {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .why-note {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .pc-only {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
